ate by check mark whether the registrant is a shell company (as defined in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act). Yes&#160;<ix:nonNumeric name="dei:EntityShellCompany" contextRef="cref_88690533" format="ixt:fixed-true" id="ixv-6088">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;&#160;&#160;No &#9744; </p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"> As of June 30, 2025, the aggregate market value of the Registrant&#8217;s ordinary shares held by non-affiliates of the Registrant was $<ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityPublicFloat" contextRef="cref_38933373" unitRef="uref_1585905108" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-6089">0</ix:nonFraction>. </p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"> As of March 30, 2026, there were <ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="cref_2029220439" unitRef="uref_2022073347" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-6090">20,873,579</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares, including Class A ordinary shares underlying the units, and <ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="cref_968689857" unitRef="uref_2022073347" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-6091">6,806,462</ix:nonFraction> Class B ordinary shares issued and outstanding. </p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-weight: bold;">DOCUMENTS INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE</span></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;